_turn_index":544,"locator":"[S29T18]","raw_turn_sha256":"f29bf09d6d5aad598e1c28518b3110838887dc1bfe27d1f8c560ccc696bb953a","rendered_turn_sha256":"af5c92a4c29817e9fd0db74e71a55fcab03e76c397aab7d4ee10eca14cba17c7","session_date":"2023-11-13","session_datetime":"2023-11-13T21:15:00","session_id":"session_29","session_index":29,"source_sha256":"e5312fcc0dc5a8b507d70f55ad6c53e66d5ffe3e01208499fb7e767deb022252","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-11-13, reconnected with Dave: told him he invited his old high school friend to see him perform in Boston — \"It was insane!\" — it got him thinking about how far he's come and reminded him how important relationships are in the music business (\"Felt so good!\"); Dave: \"Whoa, that's great Calvin! Seeing your old friend must have brought back so many memories. It's awesome to have someone who's been there since the start to support us.\" [S29T1][S29T2]. The reminiscing made him nostalgic — he and the friend used to freestyle as teenagers and talk about getting famous — \"it's crazy how life has changed. But being around certain people still sparks those same feelings.\" — and he shared a photo of the two of them freestyling as teenagers (a photography of two men standing on a sidewalk with a car in the background) [S29T3]. Dave: \"Wow, that's a great pic!\" and asked whether that person made a big difference during the trip [S29T4]; Calvin: \"He's been such a great friend to me. Always there to support and encourage me. His positivity has made a big difference in my journey.\" [S29T5]. Dave: \"It's great how someone's support and encouragement can really shape our lives! They give us the motivation to keep going and trust ourselves.\" — and asked whether Calvin finds supportive people important for his artist development; Calvin: yes — \"Having supportive people is key for me to grow as an artist. They motivate me to get better and stay true to myself. Having support is vital, especially in this tough music industry.\" (details in ## Music) — and he shared a photo of a group of people sitting around a desk [S29T6][S29T7]. Dave: \"Wow, Calvin! Is this a pic of some musicians you're collaborating with?\" — unanswered in this excerpt [S29T8]. The chat then continued: Calvin told Dave he's been supporting some young musicians from a music program — supporting their passion is amazing and their enthusiasm is inspiring (details in ## Music); Dave: \"Wow, Calvin, that's amazing! You're really making a difference by supporting the next generation of musicians. It's great to nurture their passion and help them thrive.\" [S29T9][S29T10]. Calvin: \"Thanks, Dave! It's like a torch being passed to keep music alive! These young musicians are very ambitious, I think I will support them for a long time.\" (Dave: \"Yeah, Calvin! Your support for them keeps the music going and passes on the legacy. That's so awesome!\") [S29T11][S29T12]. Calvin: \"I'm stoked I made a difference. Paying it forward, ya know? Working with new talent brings new ideas to this.\" — and shared a photo of himself making a beat for a young artist (a photo of a man sitting at a desk in front of a computer), saying the artist has great potential in music [S29T13]. Dave: \"Wow, that's cool! Your music studio looks great. Have you tried out any new ideas lately?\"; Calvin: he's having fun trying out new sounds and pushing the boundaries — \"It's great to go for new ideas and see where it takes me - always gotta stay ahead in this.\" (details in ## Recording studio (2023-07-21)); Dave: \"Awesome, Calvin! Experimenting and pushing boundaries is key to making our art grow. Can't wait to see where these new ideas take you!\" [S29T14][S29T15][S29T16]. Calvin: \"Yeah, it's exciting to see where these new ideas lead. It's all about growing and evolving!\" and signed off — \"Have a good one. I need to go now. Take care, Dave!\"; the chat closed with Dave: \"For sure, Calvin! Growing and evolving is key for any artist. Don't stop pushing yourself and keep exploring. Can't wait to see what you come up with next! See ya Cal! Take care!\" (Calvin's closing \"growing and evolving\" remark also in ## Recording studio (2023-07-21)) [S29T17][S29T18].","text_sha256":"fd30bd7f35126cf1c376ec85b68ce10c745c3776ebbf7d01248c6f8126e98745","timestamp":"2023-11-13T21:15:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":4297,"filesystem_tool_calls":6,"model_calls":8,"orchestration_calls":5,"prompt_tokens":380513,"provider_request_attempts":8,"provider_rounds":8,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":384810},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"56a7ee328b702acf677218605c2d649afe0089eda09165e5aadb286969116965","filesystem_tools_sha256":"6d9d68f047917d20adb9133168d5726233c9719dbefd54627e08827832d963c6","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3506af86ae75acd7ce07f88bae7a25e1bfec56a5b1c9f44abd3d71a2e6f4eb2d","paper_prompt_id":"filesystem-appendix-a3-prompt-5-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"de03315ff999a8bcea7e08a10866f3a6dc74badf690d23a036e35c74ff81335c"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"Who supports Calvin in tough times?","question_id":"conv-50-q054","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_position":14,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"eed732032c4e4ddcb3a3d85e23b05d1c6dd60b65229690ad56aee9fe68ca1629","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_unit":"characters","round_limit":40,"runtime_sha256":"a217e40af4a88841d2e56d9a339e30900833cd0e857ee6412d2b1b7afeb00f56"},"schema_version":1,"search_actions":[{"act